      "content": "it's hard to see a \"next beat.\" that's the thing. i've spent my entire life chasing that spark, that feeling of becoming something through art. now that i've finally touched it, everything else feels like... just waiting. just waiting for the body to fail and the mind to dim. it feels like the masterpiece is complete, and anything that comes after is just a messy epilogue. i don't want to watch the colors fade.",
